  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Framework for sustainable urban development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to develop a dynamic framework of development principles that will help the Albanian Ministry in making informed decisions. The framework will identify, attract, assess and redirect current and future investments.To achieve this, activities and capacity building are necessary to enable the National Planning Agency to work out urban development principles. The principles will be used to launch an international competition called &quot;Towards a Resilient Albanian Coast&quot; in April 2015.</narrative>
  </description>
